=== CUBRID reserved words as column names ===

  anti-pattern: key, value           -> rejected (ProgrammingError)
  value renamed only: key, val       -> rejected (ProgrammingError)
  corrected: setting_key, val        -> created
  double quotes: "key", "value"      -> created
  square brackets: [key], [value]    -> created
  backticks: `key`, `value`          -> created
  not reserved: name                 -> created

  corrected DDL round-trip: [('theme', 'dark')]
  quoted DDL round-trip:    [('theme', 'dark')]
